      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Pixal3D multi-view.\n\nAs shipped this runs upstream's bundled 4-view example (empty folder_path) -- a known-good test.\n\nYour own frames: unmute 'Pixal3D Multi-View Input' (Ctrl+M), feed the frame batch + a MASK batch (rem-bg node), set fov/azimuths/elevations, and connect its 'views' to Generate Mesh (Multi-View) instead of the folder loader. Check preview + report first: red = what the rig can't explain.\n\nFirst multi-view run downloads ~22 GB of *_mv weights."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
